            <ArticleTitle>Effective pain management of post-herpetic neuralgia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>32-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Post-herpetic neuralgia is a severe type of pain that can have a devastating impact on a patient's quality of life. Successful management requires early recognition and treatment with appropriate drugs, topical agents, non-pharmacological treatments, and psychological support.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
